@startuml

autonumber
hide footbox

title US018 - Add one of my publications to a list of mine

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

User -> System : I want to add one of my publications to a list of mine
activate System

System --> User : Here are your lists, select one
User -> System : selected a list

System --> User : Here are your publications, select one
User -> System : selected a publication

System --> User : The publication was added to the list
deactivate System

deactivate User

@enduml
